description=Mosey / Quick Share AirDrop enabler with the wonder phy baked in. Pixel 10 (blazer) uses its native BCM4398 wondertap; on devices without it the bundled wonder_mosey_wild.ko fills in. Based on feelliao's Mosey enabler - see README thanks.
